# --- MKM AI audio pipeline (optional external generator subprocess) ---
# Repo-relative or absolute path. Invoked as: py SCRIPT --seed-json ... --out-wav ... --index N --run-id ... --seconds ...
# Starter copy: scripts/audio/external_generator_template_v1.py (silence default; TODO = your model)
# Offline audition (non-silence, stdlib tone bed): scripts/audio/tone_external_generator_v1.py
# Expand (dry/live) + tone from expanded hints: scripts/audio/expand_tone_external_generator_v1.py
# ffmpeg lavfi brown-noise bed (ffmpeg optional PATH; MKM_AUDIO_FFMPEG override): scripts/audio/ffmpeg_bed_external_generator_v1.py
