# Default (no MKM_AUDIO_GEMINI_BILLING): developer = AI Studio key (GEMINI_API_KEY / GOOGLE_API_KEY), free tier within Google quotas.
# Vertex / org credits: set billing to auto or vertex and configure project + ADC.
#   GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project
#   GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=us-central1   # optional; default us-central1
#   (ADC) gcloud auth application-default login   # or workload identity on CI
# MKM_AUDIO_GEMINI_BILLING=developer   # default behavior if unset; use auto|vertex for GCP-first routing
# Batch optional: py scripts/audio/run_bgm_generation_batch.py ... --run-gate [--gate-waive-lufs] [--gate-waive-bpm-lens] [--gate-relaxed]
# MKM_AUDIO_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
# MKM_AUDIO_EXPAND_DRY_RUN=1   # wrapper passes --dry-run (no API quota)
# 가성비 원클릭: scripts/Run-AudioBgmEconomyChain_v1.ps1 (드라이런+게이트 → 선택 -Live; 예제 시드 data/audio/seeds/*.example.json)

